{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.coCasimir_wrong_sign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.coCasimir_wrong_sign","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/DeltaLambdaRefutation.lean#L90-L97","doc":"**Refutation (sign).** A stronger, scale-free defect: the co-Casimir ansatz predicts\na *positive* binding-density sum (`coCasimirSum > 0`) where the empirical target is\n*negative* (`targetSigned < 0`). The wrong sign cannot be repaired by any positive\nnormalisation `ρ > 0`, so the refutation survives the (separately gated) overall-scale\nfreedom. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.coCasimir_refuted_deuteron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.coCasimir_refuted_deuteron","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/DeltaLambdaRefutation.lean#L81-L88","doc":"**Refutation (magnitude).** The Frobenius co-Casimir `Δ_λ` ansatz misses the\ndeuteron binding-density target by more than the viability tolerance (gap ≈ 4.526\n`m_e` units > `tol = 1`). This is the machine-checked face of the witness's\n`closure_gap_LHS_minus_RHS`; it makes \"the co-Casimir ansatz is refuted\" a theorem,\nnot a prose warning. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.coCasimir_closureGap_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.coCasimir_closureGap_eq","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/DeltaLambdaRefutation.lean#L72-L79","doc":"The recorded closure gap equals `|prediction − target|` exactly (rational identity);\nthis ties the `closureGap` literal to the predicted/target literals so they cannot drift\napart independently. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.tol","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.tol","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/DeltaLambdaRefutation.lean#L67-L70","doc":"Viability tolerance: a candidate `Δ_λ` closure must land the deuteron\nbinding-density sum within `1` `m_e` unit of the empirical target to be viable.\nThe co-Casimir ansatz misses by ≈ 4.5, so the verdict is insensitive to `tol`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.closureGap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.closureGap","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/DeltaLambdaRefutation.lean#L63-L65","doc":"Closure gap `|prediction − target|`, witness `/data/.../closure_gap_LHS_minus_RHS`\n(50 dps value `4.52648796293427…`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.targetSigned","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.targetSigned","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/DeltaLambdaRefutation.lean#L58-L61","doc":"Empirical `−B_D/m_e` (in `m_e` units), the deuteron binding-density target.\n12-figure truncation of `/data/target_signed` (50 dps value `−4.35336749125644…`).\n-- Ref: [leitner2026] computations/rho-k-h3a-co-casimir.witness.json ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.coCasimirSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaRefutation.coCasimirSum","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/DeltaLambdaRefutation.lean#L51-L56","doc":"Frobenius co-Casimir predicted `Σ_λ y_λ χ^λ Δ_λ` at the deuteron (in `m_e` units).\n12-figure truncation of `/data/co_casimir_prediction/sum_contributions_signed`\n(50 dps value `0.17312047167782761…`; the witness was regenerated 2026-10-05 at the\nproton pin, and this figure was updated 2026-11-15 from the stale `0.144959224127`).\n-- Ref: [leitner2026] computations/rho-k-h3a-co-casimir.witness.json ","signatureChunk":0}]}